Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:50:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1887/3799] soh: rename func_80B8FE6C -> ObjBean_SetupSprout

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: shows the leaves and soil together and starts the plant at a tiny scale.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Bean/z_obj_bean.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Bean/z_obj_bean.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Bean/z_obj_bean.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Bean/z_obj_bean.c
index 64905431e..4d085d48e 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Bean/z_obj_bean.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Bean/z_obj_bean.c
@@ -40,7 +40,8 @@ void ObjBean_WaitForBean(ObjBean* this, PlayState* play);
 void ObjBean_SproutDelay(ObjBean* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80B8FE3C [LLM:HIGH]
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B8FE00: shows the leaves and arms the 60-frame pause before the plant sprouts.
 void ObjBean_SetupSproutDelay(ObjBean* this);  // was func_80B8FE00 [LLM:HIGH]
-void func_80B8FE6C(ObjBean* this);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B8FE6C: shows the leaves and soil together and starts the plant at a tiny scale.
+void ObjBean_SetupSprout(ObjBean* this);  // was func_80B8FE6C [LLM:HIGH]
 void func_80B8FEAC(ObjBean* this, PlayState* play);
 void func_80B8FF50(ObjBean* this);
 void ObjBean_SetupGrowWaterPhase4(ObjBean* this);
@@ -565,11 +566,11 @@ void ObjBean_SetupSproutDelay(ObjBean* this) {
 // Link is looking at the soft soil
 void ObjBean_SproutDelay(ObjBean* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (this->timer <= 0) {
-        func_80B8FE6C(this);
+        ObjBean_SetupSprout(this);  // was func_80B8FE6C [LLM:HIGH]
     }
 }
 
-void func_80B8FE6C(ObjBean* this) {
+void ObjBean_SetupSprout(ObjBean* this) {
     this->actionFunc = func_80B8FEAC;
     ObjBean_SetDrawMode(this, BEAN_STATE_DRAW_LEAVES | BEAN_STATE_DRAW_SOIL);
     Actor_SetScale(&this->dyna.actor, 0.01f);
